      "rationale": "L1 explicitly states the HA tag was inserted 'after glycine 221' in the first extracellular domain of full-length Kv2.1 (KCNB1), and L2 corroborates this with a named restriction-site insertion at Gly221. Python verification confirms residue 221 is G and residue 222 is Q, both within ECL1 (210\u2013231). The position is 12 aa from TM1 and 11 aa from TM2, providing ample room for a 15\u201323 aa ALFA-tag insert. Surface display of the epitope was directly demonstrated by live-cell antibody labeling. L1 reports a single HA epitope (YPYDVPDYA) inserted into the first extracellular domain of full-length Kv2.1 (KCNB1) after Gly221, expressed for surface labeling studies. L2 independently confirms a restriction-site-mediated insertion engineered at Gly221 in the same full-length Kv2.1 construct. Python confirms seq[220]='G' and seq[221]='Q'; position 221 lies within ECL1 (topology span 210\u2013231), 12 aa from the TM1 C-boundary (209) and 11 aa from the TM2 N-boundary (232), well clear of both TM edges. L4 confirms antibody detection of the extracellular epitope on surface-expressed channels.",
